Network services
----------------
Builds of this fork continue to use public services operated by Celzero /
serverless-dns (e.g. dl.rethinkdns.com blocklists, sky/max.rethinkdns.com
resolvers). Their use is subject to RethinkDNS's terms and privacy policy
(https://rethinkdns.com/privacy). No endorsement is implied.
